{"title": "CBI chargesheets 13 in NEET-UG paper leak; Parliament debates anti-leak bill", "summary": "The Central Bureau of Investigation (CBI) has filed a chargesheet against 13 individuals in connection with the 2026 NEET-UG examination paper leak case. The NEET-UG exam was previously cancelled, with a re-examination held on June 21. Meanwhile, in Parliament, the government introduced a bill to amend the anti-paper leak law, proposing stricter punishments including up to 10 years in jail and a Rs 50 lakh fine. The introduction of this bill followed a parliamentary stalemate over the paper leak issue.", "summary_points": ["CBI filed a chargesheet against 13 accused in the 2026 NEET-UG paper leak case.", "The NEET-UG exam was cancelled and a re-examination was conducted on June 21.", "The government introduced a bill in Lok Sabha to amend the anti-paper leak law.", "The proposed law includes stricter punishments: up to 10 years in jail and a Rs 50 lakh fine.", "Parliamentary proceedings were previously stalled due to uproar over paper leaks."], "title_hi": "सीबीआई ने NEET-UG पेपर लीक मामले में 13 लोगों के खिलाफ आरोप पत्र दाखिल किया; संसद में लीक-रोधी विधेयक पर बहस", "summary_hi": "केंद्रीय जांच ब्यूरो (CBI) ने 2026 NEET-UG परीक्षा पेपर लीक मामले में 13 व्यक्तियों के खिलाफ आरोप पत्र दायर किया है। NEET-UG परीक्षा पहले रद्द कर दी गई थी, और 21 जून को पुनः परीक्षा आयोजित की गई थी। इस बीच, संसद में सरकार ने पेपर लीक-रोधी कानून में संशोधन के लिए एक विधेयक पेश किया, जिसमें 10 साल तक की जेल और 50 लाख रुपये के जुर्माने सहित कड़ी सजा का प्रस्ताव है। इस विधेयक को पेश करना पेपर लीक के मुद्दे पर संसदीय गतिरोध के बाद हुआ।", "summary_points_hi": ["सीबीआई ने 2026 NEET-UG पेपर लीक मामले में 13 आरोपियों के खिलाफ आरोप पत्र दायर किया है।", "NEET-UG परीक्षा रद्द कर दी गई थी और 21 जून को पुनः परीक्षा आयोजित की गई थी।", "सरकार ने लोकसभा में पेपर लीक-रोधी कानून में संशोधन के लिए एक विधेयक पेश किया।", "प्रस्तावित कानून में कड़ी सजाएं शामिल हैं: 10 साल तक की जेल और 50 लाख रुपये का जुर्माना।", "पेपर लीक को लेकर हंगामे के कारण संसदीय कार्यवाही पहले बाधित हुई थी।"], "framing": {"left": "Left-leaning outlets focused on the CBI chargesheet against 13 accused in the NEET-UG paper leak case, highlighting the investigation into the examination irregularities.", "center": "Centrist coverage reported on the CBI filing chargesheet against 13 accused in the NEET-UG paper leak case and the government's introduction of a bill to amend the anti-paper leak law with stricter punishments.", "right": "Right-leaning outlets emphasized the government's legislative action to address paper leaks, highlighting the approval of a bill for stricter punishments, including a special task force and harsher penalties, and the move to clear the legislative agenda after a deadlock."}, "framing_hi": {"left": "वाम-झुकाव वाले आउटलेट्स ने NEET-UG पेपर लीक मामले में 13 आरोपियों के खिलाफ सीबीआई द्वारा आरोप पत्र दायर करने पर ध्यान केंद्रित किया, परीक्षा अनियमितताओं की जांच पर प्रकाश डाला।", "center": "मध्यमार्गी कवरेज ने NEET-UG पेपर लीक मामले में 13 आरोपियों के खिलाफ सीबीआई द्वारा आरोप पत्र दायर करने और सरकार द्वारा कड़ी सजाओं के साथ पेपर लीक-रोधी कानून में संशोधन के लिए विधेयक पेश करने की सूचना दी।", "right": "दक्षिणपंथी आउटलेट्स ने कड़ी सजाओं, जिसमें एक विशेष कार्य बल और कठोर दंड शामिल हैं, के लिए विधेयक की मंजूरी और गतिरोध के बाद विधायी एजेंडे को साफ करने के कदम पर प्रकाश डालते हुए, पेपर लीक को संबोधित करने के लिए सरकार की विधायी कार्रवाई पर जोर दिया।"}, "topic": "Crime & Law", "region": "India", "image_url": "https://images.indianexpress.com/2026/07/lok-sabha-2026.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "As Paper Leak Deadlock Ends, Government Moves to Clear Legislative Agenda in Monsoon Session"}, {"source": "Firstpost", "owner": "Network18", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Cabinet approves bill providing stricter punishments for paper leaks"}, {"source": "Deccan Chronicle", "owner": "Deccan Chronicle", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "As Parliament Stalemate Over Paper Leaks Ends, Govt to Push Key Bills"}, {"source": "India Today", "owner": "India Today Group", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Newstrack: Government approves anti-paper leak law changes amid NEET paper leak standoff - India Today"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Centre To Table Public Examinations Amendment Bill In Lok Sabha With Special Task Force, Harsher Penalties For Paper Leaks"}, {"source": "The Indian Express", "owner": "Indian Express Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://indianexpress.com/article/india/parliament-monsoon-session-2026-live-updates-neet-paper-leak-public-examinations-amendment-bill-congress-adjournment-motion-10805053", "headline": "Parliament Monsoon Session 2026 Day 6 Highlights: Houses adjourned amid uproar over Shah’s statement demand"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/clock-it-delulu-how-gen-z-lingo-took-over-parliament-during-anti-paper-leak-bill-debate/articleshow/132684933.cms", "headline": "'Clock it', 'delulu': How Gen Z lingo took over Parl during anti-paper leak Bill debate"}, {"source": "The Times of India", "owner": "Times Group", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cbi-files-chargesheet-against-13-accused-in-neet-ug-paper-leak-case-hearing-tomorrow/articleshow/132690039.cms", "headline": "CBI files chargesheet against 13 accused in NEET-UG paper leak case; hearing tomorrow"}, {"source": "NDTV", "owner": "NDTV", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/cbi